<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <title>About Us | Commoncore</title>

  <link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css"
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/user/standard.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/user/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/user/user-header.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/user/about.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/user/footer.css">
</head>

<body>

<%- include("../partials/user-header") %>

<main class="about-page">

  <section class="about-hero">

    <div class="about-hero-content">

      <p class="about-eyebrow">
        ABOUT COMMONCORE
      </p>

      <h1>
        Designed for everyone.<br>
        Made for everyday.
      </h1>

      <p class="about-hero-text">
        Commoncore is a unisex clothing store focused on
        high-quality fabrics, minimal design and effortless
        everyday comfort.
      </p>

      <a href="/user/shop" class="about-shop-btn">
        Explore Collection
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="about-story">

    <div class="story-visual">

      <img
        src="/images/commoncore-story.png"
        alt="Commoncore"
      >

    </div>

    <div class="story-content">

      <p class="section-label">
        OUR STORY
      </p>

      <h2>
        Less noise.<br>
        Better essentials.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Commoncore was created around a simple idea:
        clothing should feel good, look effortless and work
        for everyone.
      </p>

      <p>
        We focus on clean silhouettes and versatile pieces
        rather than designs that are defined by gender or
        short-lived trends. Our collections are made to fit
        naturally into everyday life.
      </p>

      <p>
        Quality is at the core of what we do. From the feel
        of the fabric to the final construction, we believe
        the essentials you wear most should also be the
        pieces you can rely on most.
      </p>

      <div class="story-signature">

        <span></span>

        <p>
          Simple. Comfortable. Common.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="about-values">

    <div class="values-heading">

      <p class="section-label">
        WHAT WE VALUE
      </p>

      <h2>
        Built around the essentials.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Everything we create starts with a few principles
        that define Commoncore.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="values-grid">

      <div class="value-card">

        <div class="value-number">
          01
        </div>

        <div class="value-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-shirt"></i>
        </div>

        <h3>
          Unisex by Design
        </h3>

        <p>
          Clothing designed beyond traditional categories,
          with versatile silhouettes made for everyone.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="value-card">

        <div class="value-number">
          02
        </div>

        <div class="value-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i>
        </div>

        <h3>
          Quality Fabrics
        </h3>

        <p>
          We prioritize fabrics that feel comfortable,
          substantial and dependable for everyday wear.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="value-card">

        <div class="value-number">
          03
        </div>

        <div class="value-icon">
          <i class="fa-regular fa-circle"></i>
        </div>

        <h3>
          Minimal Always
        </h3>

        <p>
          Clean forms, thoughtful details and understated
          colors that remain relevant beyond trends.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="about-philosophy">

    <div class="philosophy-left">

      <p class="section-label">
        OUR PHILOSOPHY
      </p>

      <h2>
        Good clothing doesn't
        need to be complicated.
      </h2>

    </div>

    <div class="philosophy-right">

      <p>
        We believe your wardrobe should make everyday
        decisions easier. Pieces should work together,
        feel comfortable and remain useful season after
        season.
      </p>

      <p>
        That's why Commoncore keeps things intentional:
        fewer distractions, thoughtful materials and
        designs that let you make them your own.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="about-banner">

    <div>

      <p class="section-label">
        COMMONCORE
      </p>

      <h2>
        Find your everyday essentials.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Minimal pieces. Quality fabrics. Made for everyone.
      </p>

    </div>

    <a href="/user/shop" class="banner-btn">
      Shop Collection
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
    </a>

  </section>

</main>

<%- include('../partials/user-footer') %>

</body>

</html>